Package: pulsaros-timemachine
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Pulsar OS Team <info@inled.es>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, btrfs-progs, restic, rclone, cifs-utils, smbclient, udisks2
Description: Pulsar OS Time Machine - Continuous Btrfs & Restic Protection
 Native backup and recovery suite for Pulsar OS supporting local Btrfs
 snapshots synced with Restic across USB, remote Samba/NAS, and Rclone cloud.
